  "fdLines": [
    {
      "day": 51,
      "line": "The feast's fire burns low — the buff fades with the night. (Feasted expired.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 51,
      "line": "🍖 FEAST 📺 — Carolina opens the pantry wide: 4× Garden harvest, 5× Foraged food (dried), 1× Foraged food. Divine, Mara, Ursula, James and 4 more eat until the fire burns low. The laughter stays low — somebody's seat is empty, and everybody sees it. For one evening, grief sits at the fire with them instead of standing over them. (−3,790 kcal from the pantry) The channeled keepsake feeds the feast — the feast was the weapon, and the surge rides the fire until tomorrow's dawn, spent only when the "
    },
    {
      "day": 51,
      "line": "🍖 FEASTED ×2.03 until tomorrow's dawn (6 parts left): a proper feast. A channeled keepsake feeds the flames (devotion ×1.5). Strikes and abilities hit with the feast behind them."
    },
    {
      "day": 51,
      "line": "🌙 The cookfire's smell carried further than the laughter did — smoke and grease on the night wind. The Anaconda Empress is circling the edge of the light. It followed the feast here. (A scavenger, drawn by the feast. Face it while the feast is in you — or let the watch drive it off.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 51,
      "line": "FEASTED ×2.03: the feast was the weapon."
    },
    {
